`--set` is repeatable and the pairs are applied in argv order, so the last one on the same key is the
one that renders.

-- fixtures/cwd/probe.md.j2 --
threshold {{ config.core.sprint.default_threshold_sp }}
-- cmd --
booping render /proc/self/cwd/probe.md.j2 --set core.sprint.default_threshold_sp=7 --set core.sprint.default_threshold_sp=9
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
threshold 9
-- stderr --
